Animation behaviour
Interaction	Target behaviour
Buttons & chips	Subtle colour, border aur press transitions
Property cards	Slight lift, restrained shadow and image zoom
Mega menu	Smooth opacity + short vertical movement
Modal & drawer	Controlled fade/slide; no abrupt pop-in
Page highlights	Subtle, staggered reveal for selected sections
Loading states	Calm skeleton pulse, no distracting shimmer
Reduced motion	Motion-sensitive users ke liye transitions disabled/reduced
Motion duration, easing, distance aur delay tokens se control honge. Gold accents restrained rahenge; animations layout ko jump nahi karayengi.
